<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<%- include('partials/head', { 
    title: "Domain Verification Failed" ,
    description: "The domain could not be verified. Please ensure the correct TXT record is set in your DNS settings." ,
    keywords: "domain verification, DNS, TXT record, Merapihost" 
}) %>

<body class="error-page">
  <section class="container">
    <header class="flex column">
      <figure class="logo">
        <%- include('partials/logo', { full: true, width: 280, height: 75, fill: '#ef1111' }) %>
        <div class="error-icon">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="50" height="50" viewBox="-25 -25 135 135">
            <path d="M 45 88.11 h 40.852 c 3.114 0 5.114 -3.307 3.669 -6.065 L 48.669 4.109 c -1.551 -2.959 -5.786 -2.959 -7.337 0 L 0.479 82.046 c -1.446 2.758 0.555 6.065 3.669 6.065 H 45 z" />
            <path d="M 45 64.091 L 45 64.091 c -1.554 0 -2.832 -1.223 -2.9 -2.776 l -2.677 -25.83 c -0.243 -3.245 2.323 -6.011 5.577 -6.011 h 0 c 3.254 0 5.821 2.767 5.577 6.011 L 47.9 61.315 C 47.832 62.867 46.554 64.091 45 64.091 z" fill="#fff" />
            <circle cx="44.995999999999995" cy="74.02600000000001" r="4.626" fill="#fff" />
          </svg>
        </div>
      </figure>
      <h1>Domain Verification Failed</h1>
    </header>

    <p class="subtitle">
      <%= domain || 'This domain' %> could not be verified
    </p>

    <article>
      <p>The domain <strong><%= domain || 'this domain' %></strong> is registered with Merapihost but failed verification.</p>
      <div class="error-details">
        <p>Possible reasons:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>DNS records haven't propagated yet</li>
          <li>Verification token is missing or incorrect</li>
          <li>Domain DNS is still pointing to the old server</li>
          <li>SSL certificate verification failed</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <br />
      <contact>
        <p class="caption">
          <strong>Need help?</strong> Contact support at
          <a href="mailto:support@merapihost.com">
            support@merapihost.com
          </a>
        </p>
      </contact>
    </article>
  </section>
  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>

</html>